(7482971, 1190639, 24744, '<td valign="top">A strong composition, and an original take on this cliche.  I feel the fade around the railway image is a little too squared off and rectangular near the top left.  The front lighting on the skin works in some parts of the image, but looks a little too waxy, especially around the ear and nose.  Nevertheless, one of my highest scores in this contest.</td>', 'A strong composition, and an original take on this cliche.  I feel the fade around the railway image is a little too squared off and rectangular near the top left.  The front lighting on the skin works in some parts of the image, but looks a little too waxy, especially around the ear and nose.  Nevertheless, one of my highest scores in this contest.', '2016-11-17 16:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7482973, 1190617, 24744, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition, if only that shrub were a little sharper though...  I would also have got rid of the sharpening halos at the edges of the dune and the background mountain.  Still, one of my highest scores in this contest.</td>', 'Very strong composition, if only that shrub were a little sharper though...  I would also have got rid of the sharpening halos at the edges of the dune and the background mountain.  Still, one of my highest scores in this contest.', '2016-11-17 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
