(7483635, 1190649, 117474, '<td valign="top">this would have worked delightfully in conjunctions too. great street image. love the perspective in size from the person on the left, centre to the back of the bus. really draws me in</td>', 'this would have worked delightfully in conjunctions too. great street image. love the perspective in size from the person on the left, centre to the back of the bus. really draws me in', '2016-11-22 05:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483637, 1189476, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Great viewpoint and composition, a very striking image that immediately grabs your attention, especially the lighting the way it picks out the dominant corner of this quite attractive building. You have made great use of the viewpoint and perspective to create an image with impact, however, I feel there is too much space above the building, I think more of a panoramic format would have worked better thereby accentuating the receding aspects of the building and emphasising the corner even more. Thanks for another interesting entry Eugene.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Great viewpoint and composition, a very striking image that immediately grabs your attention, especially the lighting the way it picks out the dominant corner of this quite attractive building. You have made great use of the viewpoint and perspective to create an image with impact, however, I feel there is too much space above the building, I think more of a panoramic format would have worked better thereby accentuating the receding aspects of the building and emphasising the corner even more. Thanks for another interesting entry Eugene.', '2016-11-22 06:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483639, 1190543, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Thanks to your title we are made to look for Waldo or else we probably would have missed him completely and because we find him it gives the whole image a sense of the immense scale of what we are looking at. The inclusion of the figure also makes the image a much more interesting image rather than a landscape alone it comes to life. As a documentary image of the power of nature to weather its surroundings it works well.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Thanks to your title we are made to look for Waldo or else we probably would have missed him completely and because we find him it gives the whole image a sense of the immense scale of what we are looking at. The inclusion of the figure also makes the image a much more interesting image rather than a landscape alone it comes to life. As a documentary image of the power of nature to weather its surroundings it works well.', '2016-11-22 06:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483640, 1190678, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>A fairly standard image of a fairly standard scene that lacks a strong focal point which is why, I assume, you have added the butterflies? Unfortunately, the butterflies are not at all convincing to the extent that they detract more than they add to the image as a whole. The colours are quite appealing but the exposure is a little on the bright side with some blown highlights though not excessive. Sorry Susie if my critique sounds a little harsh it is intended to be honest and helpful.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge A fairly standard image of a fairly standard scene that lacks a strong focal point which is why, I assume, you have added the butterflies? Unfortunately, the butterflies are not at all convincing to the extent that they detract more than they add to the image as a whole. The colours are quite appealing but the exposure is a little on the bright side with some blown highlights though not excessive. Sorry Susie if my critique sounds a little harsh it is intended to be honest and helpful.', '2016-11-22 06:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483641, 1190617, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Wow! Just what an image should do to you, make you say wow. This is a gorgeous landscape and its because of its simplicity that it has that wow effect. The composition and the colours are gorgeous, the lighting and exposure are good with good detail retained in the whites where it matters and that lovely blue backdrop really sets it off. The green bush adds a strong focal point though I think this would have worked equally well without it, adding to the scenes simplicity. A minor criticism is that there are halos, not on the dunes but on the blue mountain sky junction, they are not excessive but they are evident, apart from this the image is lovely. Congratulations Tom on your splendid score and result for a truly splendid image.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Wow! Just what an image should do to you, make you say wow. This is a gorgeous landscape and its because of its simplicity that it has that wow effect. The composition and the colours are gorgeous, the lighting and exposure are good with good detail retained in the whites where it matters and that lovely blue backdrop really sets it off. The green bush adds a strong focal point though I think this would have worked equally well without it, adding to the scenes simplicity. A minor criticism is that there are halos, not on the dunes but on the blue mountain sky junction, they are not excessive but they are evident, apart from this the image is lovely. Congratulations Tom on your splendid score and result for a truly splendid image.', '2016-11-22 06:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
