(7483726, 1190650, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alexkc:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Kinda funny that this only just scraped into the top 10. You seem to be the only one that produces really good images but don''t score as well as you probably should. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My stuff doesn''t resonate with voters lately. Not super happy with that but most important thing is real life :)<br/> <br/>Thank you so much for your comment Anita! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You''re most welcome!</td>', 'Originally posted by Alexkc: Originally posted by Neat: Kinda funny that this only just scraped into the top 10. You seem to be the only one that produces really good images but don''t score as well as you probably should.   My stuff doesn''t resonate with voters lately. Not super happy with that but most important thing is real life :) Thank you so much for your comment Anita!   You''re most welcome!', '2016-11-22 21:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
